```{r}
#| label: setup
#| include: false
source(here::here("R", "common.R"))
source(here::here("R", "coastal-flooding.R"))

meta         <- read_meta(REPO)
flood_days   <- read_indicator(REPO, "coastal_flood_days_by_site.csv")
flood_events <- read_indicator(REPO, "coastal_flood_events_by_site.csv")
```

This indicator shows how the frequency of coastal flooding has changed over time.

